              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Konye kolanirior akan naka EJAKAIT kama ejaas luka Asudod, komudia kes, kodany kes kabusion, Asudod ka iikorunoke, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodete keanyut ituŋa luka Asudod ebe ikote nen, kotemasi atiar, “Mam asaduku naka Edeke loka Isirael iboikin mamawok: naarai ededeŋ akekan kamawok, kama kaDagon da ewokodeke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kijukasi kotukokis ijaka kere luka Ipilisitian kotemasi atiar, “Kikwaikini ai asaduku naka Edeke loka Isirael? “Kobonokis atiar, “Kibwokoroi asaduku naka Edeke loka Isirael Gat.” Kibwokosi asaduku naka Edeke loka Isirael nina, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
